\n（歡迎ig追蹤生活良食，探索更多美食！）\n\n雖然價格不貴，也很有創意，烏龍麵有呼應到二郎拉麵通常都用偏粗的麵體，但有點也就這樣而已，餐點用料品質很差，蔬菜多是菜梗，菜葉殘破不堪，湯頭很淡，跟二郎講求的蒜味和濃口感完全背道而馳，原本丸龜厲害的烏龍麵口感在這碗也發揮不出來，整體很軟爛，我猜也許是因為上面放有大量蔬菜導致悶著，又加上此碗的擺盤時間比起其他碗久了一些，麵條就很容易軟化，簡單來說就是不推薦，大雷😢。\n\n#台灣美食 #台灣美食地圖 #taiwanfood #taiwanfoodie\n#台北美食 #台灣夜市 #taipeifoodie #taipei\n#taiwanesefood #taiwanesetea\n#平民美食 #高cp值 #afordable  #平價美食 #丸龜 #丸龜製麵 #二郎 #二郎烏龍麵#二郎系",null,[0,23]]]],[null,1760923812000000,1760923812000000,"10 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfVnZMLXg4WFlfNmJwWDZ0U0p3QlhkZw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfVnZMLXg4WFlfNmJwWDZ0U0p3QlhkZxoTQ2d3SXBLSFd4d1lRaE1HcHNnTQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwi609SXwdKWAxV1U_UHHXvBErUQ_2MIzAEoDw"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/16959451752942672530/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhLUkZJeFRUVlRWa0kyV2xWak5HRnFVbXRUYld4V1pGVmtWbFZJWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16959451752942672530/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhLUkZJeFRUVlRWa0kyV2xWak5HRnFVbXRUYld4V1pGVmtWbFZJWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/16959451752942672530/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhLUkZJeFRUVlRWa0kyV2xWak5HRnFVbXRUYld4V1pGVmtWbFZJWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16959451752942672530/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhLUkZJeFRUVlRWa0kyV2xWak5HRnFVbXRUYld4V1pGVmtWbFZJWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/16959451752942672530/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhLUkZJeFRUVlRWa0kyV2xWak5HRnFVbXRUYld4V1pGVmtWbFZJWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16959451752942672530/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhLUkZJeFRUVlRWa0kyV2xWak5HRnFVbXRUYld4V1pGVmtWbFZJWXhBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["親愛的顧客您好，\n抱歉讓您有不好的消費體驗，會轉達給營業主管進行瞭解，為了解您當下的用餐體驗與餐點問題，懇請您提供當天的用餐日期\u0026消費時間點以及您的聯繫方式